<h3>Chemicals downloads</h3>

<div class="well">
  <p><strong>Sector benchmarks</strong> export (ZIP) includes only the three subsector benchmark sets: Primary chemicals, Non-primary chemicals, and Agricultural chemicals (three scenarios each).</p>
  <p><strong>Chemicals benchmarks</strong> export includes all Chemicals rows, including company-specific benchmarks (e.g. BASF). Use identical Subsector or Benchmark Label on assessment uploads so per-company Benchmark ID in CP assessment exports resolves correctly.</p>
</div>

<h3>Partial updates limitations</h3>

<div class="well">
  It is not possible to change emission values only for chosen years. You have to provide all emissions in dynamic year columns.
</div>

<h3>Column descriptions</h3>

<%= render partial: 'admin/data_uploads/instruction/column_descriptions_notes' %>

<table class="index_table">
  <thead>
    <th>Column Name</th>
    <th>Description</th>
    <th>Example</th>
    <th>Requirements</th>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <%= render partial: 'admin/data_uploads/instruction/column_id' %>
    <tr>
      <td>
        Sector
      </td>
      <td>
        Sector name for the benchmark
      </td>
      <td>
        Steel
      </td>
      <td>
        Required if column present
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>
        Release date
      </td>
      <td>
        Date of benchmark release, Allowed date formats: YYYY-MM-DD
      </td>
      <td>
        2021-02
      </td>
      <td>
        Required if column present
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>
        Scenario
      </td>
      <td>
        Benchmark scenario, type: string
      </td>
      <td>
        Below 2 Degrees
      </td>
      <td>
        Required if column present
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>
        Subsector
      </td>
      <td>
        Match key for company-specific benchmarks (Chemicals sector). Must match the same string on assessment upload rows.
      </td>
      <td>
        Primary chemicals
      </td>
      <td>
        Optional; preferred for Chemicals when pairing benchmarks with assessments
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>
        Benchmark Label
      </td>
      <td>
        Company-specific benchmark identifier. For Chemicals, copied to Subsector when Subsector is blank. Must match Subsector or Benchmark Label on assessment rows.
      </td>
      <td>
        BASF
      </td>
      <td>
        Optional
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>
        Region
      </td>
      <td>
        Benchmark region, one of: <%= CP::Benchmark::REGIONS.join(', ') %>
      </td>
      <td>
        Global
      </td>
      <td>
        Required if column present
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>
        [year] - Dynamic year columns ex. 2020, 2021, 2022
      </td>
      <td>
        Each column indicate benchmark emission value for given year. Unit is set by sector in sector details page. Type: number
      </td>
      <td>
        118.884
      </td>
      <td>
        See partial updates limitations
      </td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
